OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAway from
OL,6,Fthe far northwest it will remain
OL,7,Flargely cloudy with drizzly showers
OL,8,Ffor the northeast and Northern
OL,9,FIreland. Heavier showers for some,
OL,10,Falong southwestern coasts. Fog and
OL,11,Ffrost patches are most likely in
OL,12,Fnorthwest Scotland. Temperatures near
OL,13,Faverage.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FA cloudy, gloomy day for most,
OL,16,Fparticularly for Wales and southern
OL,17,FEngland under spells of rain. Drizzly
OL,18,Fshowers in the northeast, and heavy
OL,19,Fshowers in the far southwest. Feeling
OL,20,Fchilly.
